	(text "1–2  USB-C INPUT, CC SINK, AND ESD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50 15 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.3)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 90 140 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "61e53b5b-3b7b-4802-a473-4848cff7a12c")
	)
	(text "3–4  CH340C USB-UART / AUTO PROGRAM"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 125 15 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.3)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 90 140 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "824fb64e-c92e-4606-bc04-116a53961211")
	)
	(text "GPIO19/20 carry native USB D-/D+ through 22-ohm resistors. USB Serial/JTAG supports automatic download.\nVBUS is sensed through Q1 for self-powered USB-device firmware; this Type-C port remains a sink/device, not a host power source."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 128 72 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.78 0.78)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "7a5ef545-3dff-43cd-b432-b0a227415656")
	)
	(text "5  TP4056 CHARGER (~500 mA)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45 88 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.3)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 90 140 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "d909bf71-0d85-46cb-9504-6af73ca5c95d")
	)
	(text "6  CELL PROTECTION (DW01A + FS8205A)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 145 88 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.3)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 90 140 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "ee51798a-f54a-428d-aadd-e2eefa4c32d1")
	)
	(text "Overcurrent estimate: 150mV typical / (2×25mΩ) ≈3.0A at high gate;\n150mV / (2×35mΩ) ≈2.14A at low gate. Tolerance/temp range is broader."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 104 151 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "7b4c4710-9974-47c2-b88f-a553ab9f2404")
	)
	(text "7–10  LOAD SHARE, PTC, SWITCH, 3.3 V BUCK-BOOST"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 218 88 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.3)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 90 140 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "a7cb6bfd-b2ec-4782-abc7-9fda33ecb05b")
	)
	(text "USB present: D1 powers SYS_RAW and Q4 is off; TP4056 independently charges BAT_CELL.\nUSB absent: Q4 body diode starts SYS_RAW then P-MOS turns on. Switch is downstream of charger.\nTPS63021 maintains 3.3V in buck/transition/boost; TI specifies 2A for VIN >2.5V. 2.2uH is sized for this <=1A rail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 219 151 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.74 0.74)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "f865335e-50c9-4711-9134-a8974e9e21d2")
	)
	(text "11–12  ESP32-WROOM MODULE, ADC, AND SX1262 RADIO"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 58 174 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.3)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 90 140 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "1aa908e5-0bc5-4930-acfa-7fc47f749b66")
	)
	(text "BAT_SENSE uses ADC1 GPIO1; POT_ADC uses ADC1 GPIO2. 100k/100k gives 4.2V -> 2.1V; 21uA drain.\nFirmware: warn about 3.3V and orderly shutdown about 3.0-3.1V loaded; DW01 cutoff is backup only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 276 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.78 0.78)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "c5c845ed-3401-47f7-af4f-a9d572a7ddcf")
	)
	(text "13–15  I2S MICROPHONE, CLASS-D AMP, SPEAKER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 142 174 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.3)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 90 140 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "d2551daa-fa6d-41f8-961c-93bad583c19b")
	)
	(text "GAIN_SLOT tied directly to GND = +12dB. GPIO4 high enables left-channel audio; low shuts down.\nMAX98357A raw supply sees ≈3.0–4.2V battery or ≈4.7V from USB after SS34 (<5.5V max)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 143 260 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.78 0.78)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "627e9885-b655-44c5-bf01-8ac72a69b424")
	)
	(text "16  COMMERCIAL SSD1306 I2C OLED MODULE HEADER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292 174 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.3)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 90 140 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "f115720d-5ff2-4b56-94c8-2517598476b6")
	)
	(text "Four through-hole connections only: pin 1 GND, pin 2 3V3, pin 3 SCL, pin 4 SDA.\nThe commercial module supplies its own SSD1306 charge-pump parts; no raw SYS_SW reaches OLED logic."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292 276 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.78 0.78)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "4b651431-bb8a-43fe-ba68-56368ebc9d10")
	)
	(text "17–20  POT, LED, 5× TWO-PIN BUTTONS, TEST PADS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 142 282 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.3)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 90 140 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "a64bb785-02b9-4579-a3d9-8f1d9e6560d2")
	)
	(text "Buttons: ESP32-S3 GPIO4/5/6/7/15 -> switch -> GND; firmware enables internal pull-ups.\nThere are exactly 10 button holes, 3 pot holes, 2 LED holes, 4 OLED holes, and 2 power-switch holes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 260 332 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.78 0.78)
				(color 70 70 70 1)
			)
		)
		(uuid "e6468ad5-aa77-456f-9b8a-0288e7a26bc3")
	)
