	(text "SOFT POWER: hold BTN5 for 2 s. A press immediately wakes hardware; firmware must assert GPIO12/PWR_HOLD only after validating the full 2 s startup hold. While running, release PWR_HOLD after a 2 s shutdown hold; power drops when BTN5 is released. Typical OFF leakage target <2 uA; verify prototypes over temperature."
